@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+TransLite deployment, 2026-10-06
+Upstream: https://codeberg.org/gospodin/translite
+Revision: 7b4b8e51359338219463f14c2a06211b6998a11e
+License: Unlicense; original LICENSE and notices retained.
+
+Utilibre modifications: required POST, 2,000-character server limit, no shared
+translation-content cache, request-local memoization, language-only APCu cache,
+bounded verified HTTPS with fixed hosts and public-IP-pinned dialing, upstream
+failure cooldown, controlled engine list, no text-bearing audio URLs, short-lived
+RAM sessions, secure cookies, privacy notice and matching modified-source link.
+No custom Utilibre return-link navigation was added.
+
+Build both targets with Dockerfile.utilibre, using compose.translite.yaml and
+the FPM/gateway/network policy from the Utilibre deployment repository.
+No passwords, private data or API keys are needed for this source build.
